  "description": "So-Hee lived and worked with her mother in Seonamjae. One day, her mother dies an unfair death, and she resolves to take revenge. That was the only reason she remained in the dreary Seonamjae. The day finally arrives, and she meets that man. The time to achieve her dream has finally come.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12212928)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854375), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14654634)",
